{"id":"vod_bf_24063","vodId":"24063","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"魔性之线魔性之线","name_cn":"魔性之线魔性之线","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-25/b8ffe8ad072ec74eaca43dda508395df.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个吸血鬼和人类共同生活的世界，近日里，常常发生吸血鬼袭击人类的案件，搅的人心惶惶，大家都生活在恐慌之中。彩纱（石川由依 配音）是一个平凡的大学女研究生，一天，她的同学邀请彩纱出来玩，两人一玩就玩到了半夜，此时，同学露出了真实的面目，原来他竟然就是吸血鬼连环杀人案件的元凶，而彩纱是他的下一个目标。　　就在彩纱命悬一线之际，名为安斋结贵（松冈祯丞 配音）的男子出现在了两人的面前，成为了彩纱的救世主。原来，安斋是警视厅公安五课F班的搜查官，虽然自己也是吸血鬼，但却是一名吸血鬼猎人。安斋不仅救了彩纱，还夺走了她的初吻，令彩纱坠入了情网之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 08:55:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OAD","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/OAD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/moxingzhixianmoxingzhixian/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.